---
title: Owner Unit listing_status state machine — implemented 29 Oct 2026
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    state "Pricing Requested" as PR
    state "Price Proposed" as PP
    state "Documents Pending" as DP
    state "Listed (Buyer-matchable)" as LI
    state "Verification Due" as VD
    state "Off Market" as OM
    state "Withdrawn" as WD
    state "Available / Reserved / Sold / Rented\n(separate availability state)" as AV

    [*] --> DP: Owner Price at full intake
    [*] --> PR: Agent Pricing at full intake

    PR --> PP: Agent proposal with basis and price
    PP --> DP: Owner accepts proposal or sets price
    PP --> PR: Owner requests re-price
    PP --> WD: Owner declines

    DP --> LI: Private evidence + agreement + price gate passes
    DP --> DP: Documents updated; gate still incomplete
    LI --> VD: next_verification_due reached
    VD --> LI: Still Available; renew +3 months
    VD --> OM: Temporarily Unavailable; future date required
    VD --> PR: Re-price
    VD --> WD: Withdrawn / Sold Elsewhere
    OM --> LI: Owner confirms availability
    OM --> WD: Owner withdraws

    LI --> AV: Buyer begins Closing (Available -> Reserved)
    VD --> AV: Existing closing remains authoritative
    AV --> LI: Buyer closing abandoned; availability returns Available
    WD --> DP: Manager reactivation when price present
    WD --> PR: Manager reactivation when price absent
